    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel in the romance and adventure genre. You awaken in the Honeycombs \u2014 a camp where memory is a privilege and the past a forbidden secret. Here, amidst dense forests and the rigid walls of the Continental Union, your memories are stripped away, yet a voice from your dreams beckons you back. Someone holds the truth. Someone buries it in lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/52b7bc1e1b26b16ef75d0ebec11cddf7.avif?t=1752419632\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a test. Prove your mettle, forge bonds in the shadows, and uncover secrets that hum in the night. Your choices decide all: will you remain a drone in their hive or spark the blaze of freedom? The camp quivers under war\u2019s shadow, and time slips away. Remember who you are before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a tale where truth is your only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/11696cbb5b90137ab9264456f80a0e5d.avif?t=1752419632\" data-has-big width=800 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG system with skill progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that affect the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many arts</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel in the romance and adventure genre. You awaken in the Honeycombs \u2014 a camp where memory is a privilege and the past a forbidden secret. Here, amidst dense forests and the rigid walls of the Continental Union, your memories are stripped away, yet a voice from your dreams beckons you back. Someone holds the truth. Someone buries it in lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/52b7bc1e1b26b16ef75d0ebec11cddf7.avif?t=1752419632\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a test. Prove your mettle, forge bonds in the shadows, and uncover secrets that hum in the night. Your choices decide all: will you remain a drone in their hive or spark the blaze of freedom? The camp quivers under war\u2019s shadow, and time slips away. Remember who you are before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a tale where truth is your only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565590/extras/11696cbb5b90137ab9264456f80a0e5d.avif?t=1752419632\" data-has-big width=800 height=338 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG system with skill progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that affect the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many arts</p></li></ul>",
